WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Two defenders can reach the ball. Clear communication keeps the play organized.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
In this example, the closer player calls: I got it!

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The teammate hears the call and moves behind to back up.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
On a pop-up, listen to the call and your coach’s priority system.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
One player catches or fields. Everyone else still has a job.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Use a loud voice, keep watching the ball, and help your teammate.
